
# 2025-11-20 21:14:29.814559
+Code the following app
+```
+Description:
+Token Swap Optimizer helps crypto users find the most efficient swaps across multiple DEXs. Minimize fees, get the best rates, and execute trades with confidence.
+
+Key Features:
+ • Real-time comparison of token swap rates across popular DEXs.
+ • Automated suggestions for optimal swap paths.
+ • Fee and slippage estimation for each trade.
+ • Support for multiple EVM chains (Ethereum, Polygon, BSC, etc.).
+ • Simple interface for both casual users and active traders.
+
+Target Users:
+Crypto traders and DeFi users who want to maximize swap efficiency and minimize costs.
+
+Usage Instructions:
+ 1. Select the token you want to swap and the token you want to receive.
+ 2. View optimized swap paths and estimated costs.
+ 3. Execute trades directly or set alerts for favorable rates.
+ 4. Track historical swap data to improve trading decisions.
+
+Benefits:
+ • Save money by finding the best swap rates.
+ • Reduce transaction costs and slippage.
+ • Make faster, smarter trading decisions across multiple platforms.
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

